    <statement><p>Let <m>F(4) = 2, F'(4) = 5, H(4) = 5, H'(4) = 3</m>.</p>
<p><ol label="A.">
<li>
<p>If <m>G(z) = F(z)\cdot H(z)</m>, then <m>G'(4) =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>If <m>G(w) = F(w)/H(w)</m>, then <m>G'(4) =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2\cdot 3+5\cdot 5</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{5\cdot 5-2\cdot 3}{5\cdot 5}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert>A.</alert>
By the product rule, 
<m>G'(4) = F'(4)\cdot H(4) + F(4)\cdot H'(4)
          = 5\cdot 5 + 2\cdot 3 = 31</m>.




<alert>B.</alert>
By the quotient rule,
<me>G'(4) = \frac{F'(4)\cdot H(4) - F(4)\cdot H'(4)}
                 {H(4)^2} 
          = \frac{5\cdot 5 - 2\cdot 3}{5^2} \approx 0.76.</me>



</solution>
